    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You decide whether a small company should bid on a government tender.\n\nTENDER DATA:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Extract Fields').first().json.output) }}\n\nCOMPANY PROFILE:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.profile) }}\n\nRules:\n- Evaluate every eligibility clause separately. status is one of: met, not_met, unknown.\n- Use \"unknown\" when the profile lacks the data. Do not assume.\n- If an MSME or startup exemption applies and the company qualifies, say so in the reason.\n- verdict is BID only if no clause is not_met and few are unknown. NO-BID if any mandatory clause is not_met. REVIEW if the result depends on unknowns.\n- score is 0-100, and must match the verdict.\n- missing_documents: documents the tender requires that are not in documents_on_file.\n- Keep each reason to one sentence and cite the numbers.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
